<section class="box glass" style="padding:16px 15px;margin-top:12px"><div class="ttl2"><span>Sleep and next morning</span><span>Morning energy</span></div>${se.hi.n&&se.lo.n?`<div class="wg2" style="margin:0"><div><small>AFTER 7H OR MORE</small><b style="color:#34d399">${se.hi.avg.toFixed(1)}</b><span class="m">n = ${se.hi.n} night${se.hi.n>1?'s':''}</span></div><div><small>AFTER LESS</small><b style="color:#60a5fa">${se.lo.avg.toFixed(1)}</b><span class="m">n = ${se.lo.n} night${se.lo.n>1?'s':''}</span></div></div>${evp(se.ev)}<p class="hint" style="margin:8px 0 0">${se.ev==='insuf'?'Each group needs at least 2 nights with a morning energy rating.':'Small sample. Other things that affect energy are not accounted for.'} Association, not proof of cause.</p>`:'<p class="hint" style="margin:0">Needs nights of both kinds (7 hours or more, and shorter) with a morning energy rating (5 AM to noon).</p>'}</section>
